   149	
   150	# SimAI-Simulation Usage
   151	## 📝 Workload Generate
   152	
   153	Using the same workload as SimAI-Analytical, generated by [SimAI-WorkloadGenerator](https://github.com/aliyun/aicb?tab=readme-ov-file#generate-workloads-for-simulation-simai) feature in [AICB](https://github.com/aliyun/aicb).
   154	
   155	## 🔧 TOPO Setting
   156	Before running SimAI-Simulator, you need to generate a topo file that can be recognized by ns-3-alibabacloud.
   157	### TOPO Templates
   158	To enhance convenience, we provide 5 templates for common architectures, including Spectrum-X, Single Plane AlibabaHPN, Dual Plane Alibaba HPN and DCN+. The parameter `-topo` can be set.These five figures give an overview of them. 
   159	If you want to know more about dual-ToR and dual-plane, please read the article of [HPN 7.0](https://ennanzhai.github.io/pub/sigcomm24-hpn.pdf)
   160	<table>
   161	  <tr>
   162	    <td><img src="./images/Spectrum-X.jpg" alt="Spectrum-X" style="width:100%"><br><p>Spectrum-X(One Pod)</p></td>
   163	  </tr>
   164	  <tr>
   165	    <td><img src="./images/DCN+SingleToR.jpg" alt="DCN+" style="width:100%"><br><p>DCN+SingleToR(One Pod)</p></td>
   166	    <td><img src="./images/DCN+DualToR.jpg" alt="DCN+" style="width:100%"><br><p>DCN+DualToR(One Pod)</p></td>    
   167	  </tr>
   168	  <tr>
   169	    <td><img src="./images/HPNSinglePlane.jpg" alt="AlibabaHPN_SinglePlane" style="width:100%"><br><p>AlibabaHPN with Single Plane(One Pod)</p></td>
   170	    <td><img src="./images/HPNDualPlane.jpg" alt="AlibabaHPN_DualPlane" style="width:100%"><br><p>AlibabaHPN with Dual Plane(One Pod)</p></td>
   171	    
   172	  </tr>
   173	</table>
   174	
   175	
   176	The following command generates the Spectrum-X topology with 8 GPUs shown in the image:
   177	```bash
   178	python3 ./astra-sim-alibabacloud/inputs/topo/gen_Topo_Template.py -topo Spectrum-X -g 8 -psn 1
   179	```
   180	<img src="./images/Spectrum.jpg" alt="Spectrum" style="width:50%">
   181	
   182	The following tables give the description of parameters in layer level, and show the default parameters of each template. Users can change the `-topo` name and corresponding `-g` to generate topology of corresponding structure. Notice that if the gpu num is not enter, then the topology of one Pod of each template will be generated. 
   183	(Gpus more than one pod are not supported right now.)
   184	
   185	| Parameter Level | Parameter  | Description |
   186	|-----------------|------------|-------------|
   187	| Whole Structure | `-topo`    | Template for topology |
   188	|                 | `-g`       | Number of GPUs |
   189	|                 | `--dp`     | Enable dual plane, default single plane |
   190	|                 | `--ro`     | Enable rail-optimized |
   191	|                 | `--dt`     | Enable dual nics and dual ToRs |
   192	|                 | `-er`      | Error rate |
   193	| Intra-Host      | `-gps`     | GPU per server |
   194	|                 | `-gt`      | GPU type |
   195	|                 | `-nsps`    | NV switch per server |
   196	|                 | `-nvbw`    | NVLink bandwidth |
   197	|                 | `-nl`      | NVLink latency |
   198	|                 | `-l`       | NIC latency |
   199	| Intra-Segment   | `-bw`      | NIC to ASW bandwidth |
   200	|                 | `-asw`     | ASW switch num |
   201	|                 | `-nps`     | NICs per switch (Connected GPUs per ASW) |
   202	| Intra-Pod       | `-psn`     | PSW switch num |
   203	|                 | `-apbw`    | ASW to PSW bandwidth |
   204	|                 | `-app`     | ASW per PSW |
   205	
   206	
   207	| Parameter Level | Parameter  | Spectrum-X  | AlibabaHPN_Single_Plane | AlibabaHPN_Dual_Plane | DCN+DualPlane | DCN+SinglePlane |
   208	|-----------------|------------|-------------|-------------------------|-----------------------|---------------|---------------|
   209	| Whole Structure | `-topo`    | `Spectrum-X`| `AlibabaHPN`            | `AlibabaHPN`          | `DCN+`        | `DCN+`        |
   210	|                 | `-g`       | 4096        | 15360                   | 15360                 | 512           | 512           |
   211	|                 | `--dp`     | false       | false                   | true                  | false         | false         |
   212	|                 | `--ro`     | true        | true                    | true                  | false         | false         |
   213	|                 | `--dt`     | false       | true                    | true                  | true          | false         |
   214	|                 | `-er`      | 0           | 0                       | 0                     | 0             | 0             |
   215	| Intra-Host      | `-gps`     | 8           | 8                       | 8                     | 8             | 8             |
   216	|                 | `-gt`      | H100        | H100                    | H100                  | H100          | A100          |
   217	|                 | `-nsps`    | 1           | 1                       | 1                     | 1             | 1             |
   218	|                 | `-nvbw`    | 2880Gbps    | 2880Gbps                | 2880Gbps              | 2880Gbps      | 2880Gbps      |
   219	|                 | `-nl`      | 0.000025ms  | 0.000025ms              | 0.000025ms            | 0.000025ms    | 0.000025ms    |
   220	|                 | `-l`       | 0.0005ms    | 0.0005ms                | 0.0005ms              | 0.0005ms      | 0.0005ms      |
   221	| Intra-Segment   | `-bw`      | 400Gbps     | 200Gbps                 | 200Gbps               | 200Gbps       | 400Gbps       |
   222	|                 | `-asw`     | 64          | 120                     | 120                   | 2             | 1             |
   223	|                 | `-nps`     | 64          | 128                     | 128                   | 128           | 64            |
   224	| Intra-Pod       | `-psn`     | 64          | 120                     | 120                   | 8             | 4             |
   225	|                 | `-apbw`    | 400Gbps     | 400Gbps                 | 400Gbps               | 400Gbps       | 400Gbps       |
   226	|                 | `-app`     | 64          | 240                     | 120                   | 8             | 4             |
   227	
   228	Topology of each template can be generated according to different `-topo` name and parameters:
   229	For Dual-Plane AlibabaHPN with 64 gpus, 16 asn and 16 psn, the following command can be used:
   230	```bash
   231	python3 ./astra-sim-alibabacloud/inputs/topo/gen_Topo_Template.py -topo AlibabaHPN --dp -g 64 -asn 16 -psn 16
   232	```
   233	For Dual-ToR DCN, with 128 gpus, 2 asn, 8psn, the following command can be used:
   234	```bash
   235	python3 ./astra-sim-alibabacloud/inputs/topo/gen_Topo_Template.py -topo DCN+ --dt -g 128 -asn 2 -psn 8
   236	```
   237	Please notice that `--ro` `--dt` `--dp` are invalid for `Spectrum-X`(Be set to be Rail-Optimized Single-ToR Single Plane), `--ro` `--dt` are invalid for `AlibabaHPN`(Rail-Optimized Dual Plane, would be Single Plane or Dual Plane), `--ro` `--dp`  are invalid for `DCN+`(No Rail-Optimized Single Plane, would be Single ToR or Dual ToR).
   238	
   239	The user can customize the topology themselves. For example, if you want to construct a rail-optimized single ToR topology with 32 GPUs and 200Gbps bandwidth with A100 and 8psn, you can enter the following command:
   240	```bash
   241	python3 ./astra-sim-alibabacloud/inputs/topo/gen_Topo_Template.py -g 32 -bw 200Gbps -gt A100 -psn 8 --ro
   242	```
   243	
   244	## 🖥️ SimAI-NS3 Simulation
   245	
   246	```bash
   247	$ AS_SEND_LAT=3 AS_NVLS_ENABLE=1 ./bin/SimAI_simulator -t 16 -w ./example/microAllReduce.txt -n  ./Spectrum-X_8g_8gps_400Gbps_H100  -c astra-sim-alibabacloud/inputs/config/SimAI.conf
   248	```
   249	
   250	| Environment Variable Name | Description                      | Default Value                             |
   251	|---------------------------|----------------------------------|-------------------------------------------|
   252	| `AS_LOG_LEVEL`            | Log level                        | `DEBUG`, `INFO`, `WARNING`, `ERROR`, `UNKNOWN`; default is `INFO` |
   253	| `AS_PXN_ENABLE`           | Enable PXN                       | `0/1`; default is `false`                 |
   254	| `AS_NVLS_ENABLE`          | Enable NVLS                      | `0/1`; default is `false`                 |
   255	| `AS_SEND_LAT`             | Set packet sending latency       | Default is `6`, unit is `us`              |
   256	| `AS_NVLSTREE_ENABLE`      | Enable NVLSTREE                  | Default is `false`                        |
   257	
   258	| Parameter                  | Description                              | Default Value                                                      |
   259	|----------------------------|------------------------------------------|--------------------------------------------------------------------|
   260	| `-t  --thread`            | Number of threads for multithreading acceleration | Default is `1`; if multithreading is enabled, control the number of threads between `8` and `16`. |
   261	| `-w  --workload`          | Path to workload                         | `./microAllReduce.txt`                                             |
   262	| `-n  --network-topo`      | Network topology path                    | None    
   263	
